{"meta":{"id":"import","category":"it/syntax/python/files","title":"import · 패키지 · Python","subtitle":"(PYTHON)","summary":"import / from import / 상대 import, TYPE_CHECKING, __all__, __init__.py","tags":["python","f-import"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>PYTHON</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">import · 패키지 · Python</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> import / from import / 상대 import, TYPE_CHECKING, __all__, __init__.py</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">import</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">import os\r\nimport numpy as np\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\nfrom app.services.user import UserService      # 패키지 경로 (폴더/파일)\r\nfrom .user import UserService                   # 상대 import (같은 패키지)\r\nfrom typing import TYPE_CHECKING\r\nif TYPE_CHECKING:                               # 타입 전용 import (import type 대응)\r\n    from app.models import User\r\n\r\n__all__ = [&quot;UserService&quot;]                       # from x import * 로 내보낼 이름</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">export 문법이 없다 — 모듈 최상위 이름은 모두 import 가능, _이름 은 내부용 관례</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">폴더를 패키지로 쓰려면 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>__init__.py</code> (3.3+ 는 없어도 동작)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>if __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:</code> — 직접 실행할 때만 동작하는 코드</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › import / export, Java › package · import</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/files/import","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"files","title":"파일","path":"it/syntax/python/files"}],"hasImage":false}